OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition to 'bust myth' about
OL,4,Aloyalist prisoners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition aims to "bust the
OL,7,Fmyth" that loyalist prisoners during
OL,8,Fthe Troubles were poorly educated and
OL,9,Fwithout political thinking, an
OL,10,Fex-prisoner turned community worker and
OL,11,Facademic has said.
OL,13,FLong Kesh: Inside Out, on Belfast's
OL,14,FShankill Road, tells the story of
OL,15,Floyalist prisoners held in Long Kesh -
OL,16,Flater the Maze - prison.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
