OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition to 'bust myth' about
OL,4,Aloyalist prisoners
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliam Mitchell said the exhibition
OL,7,Fdoes not seek to "condone, excuse or
OL,8,Fglorify any of their experiences. Quite
OL,9,Fthe opposite. What we're doing is
OL,10,Ftrying to create a new understanding of
OL,11,Fthem," he added.
OL,13,FMitchell said "anybody and everybody"
OL,14,Fwas welcome to come to see the
OL,15,Fexhibition and that some republican
OL,16,Fex-prisoners had already visited.
